;; ===========================================================================
;; SCAFFOLDING ONLY — babashka execution does NOT work yet.
;;
;; This bb.edn documents the eventual babashka target for fulcro-tui, but the
;; TUI does not run under babashka today. Two blockers must be resolved in
;; Fulcro CORE first:
;;
;;   1. Fulcro's `Mutation` is a `deftype` that implements
;;      `clojure.lang.IFn`. Babashka's SCI interpreter cannot create a type
;;      that implements IFn, so `defmutation` / mutation invocation fails to
;;      load.
;;
;;   2. The `org.clojure/spec.alpha` and `org.clojure/clojurescript` jars
;;      pulled in transitively by Fulcro shadow babashka's built-in versions
;;      of those namespaces, breaking the bb runtime.
;;
;; Until both are fixed upstream, do NOT add bb tasks that pretend to run the
;; TUI. Run the demo on the JVM instead:  clojure -M:tui -m tui-example.form
;;
;; Note: babashka bundles JLine, so there is intentionally no org.jline/jline
;; dependency here (unlike deps.edn, which needs it on the JVM).
;; ===========================================================================
{:paths ["src/main" "src/tui-example"]
 :deps  {com.fulcrologic/fulcro {:local/root "../fulcro"}}}
